<title>UK: IPE Brent oil futures to resume trading at 1915 GMT.</title>
<headline>IPE Brent oil futures to resume trading at 1915 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPE Brent crude futures will resume trading at 1915 GMT on Friday, the IPE told floor brokers.</p>
<p>Brent trading had been stopped at about 1820 GMT after a power cut blanked out the main price board on the pit floor.</p>
<p>--London newsroom 542 4984</p>
</text>
